{"step_index":313,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-07T19:43:48Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-08T01:13:48+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-09-08T01:13:48+05:30\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/brain/fb69bf55-26d8-4420-a8a5-e461b2943c07/walkthrough.md`\nTotal Lines: 127\nTotal Bytes: 8633\nShowing lines 1 to 127\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # NEXUS // Criminal Network Analysis Intelligence Dashboard\n2: \n3: NEXUS is an AI-powered criminal network analysis frontend designed for law enforcement and intelligence task forces. Built with React 19, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS, React Router, and tactical UI primitives inspired by Palantir Gotham, Analyst's Notebook, and Maltego.\n4: \n5: ---\n6: \n7: ## Workspace Location\n8: The complete frontend project has been created and verified at:\n9: `C:\\Users\\Nityam Jaiswal\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\nexus`\n10: \n11: ---\n12: \n13: ## Key Features & Completed Pages\n14: \n15: ### 1. Login (`/login`)\n16: - **Law-Enforcement Gate**: Title 18 U.S.C. § 1030 warning header with real-time AES-256 link status.\n17: - **Officer Credentials**: Badge ID (`FED-8491`), encrypted hardware token PIN, and division selector (Transnational Crime, Cyber Warfare, Anti-Money Laundering, INTERPOL).\n18: - **Biometric Simulation**: Live hardware token validation sequence.\n19: - **Evaluation Profiles**: One-click quick-login triggers for \"Lead Investigator Sarah Vance\" and \"SIGINT Analyst\".\n20: \n21: ### 2. Dashboard (`/`)\n22: - **Command Center Telemetry**: Real-time status indicators with DEFCON-3 alert badge and sector telemetry.\n23: - **Tactical KPI Metric Cards**:\n24:   - *Active High-Value Targets* (42 HVTs with sparkline)\n25:   - *Tracked Illicit Financial Flow* ($148.6M across 16 jurisdictions)\n26:   - *Live Intercept Feeds* (189 active feeds)\n27:   - *AI Anomaly Threat Index* (84.2 with neural recalculation)\n28: - **Embedded Network Topolog\n<truncated 5650 bytes>\n(file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/components/common/DataTable.tsx) | Generic sortable, searchable, paginated tactical table component |\n101: | **NetworkGraphContainer** | [NetworkGraphContainer.tsx](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/components/network/NetworkGraphContainer.tsx) | Interactive SVG network graph with pan, zoom, node selection, edge labeling, and filtering |\n102: | **EvidenceCard** | [EvidenceCard.tsx](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/components/common/EvidenceCard.tsx) | Evidence cards with SHA-256 copy, file format badges, and raw intercept modal |\n103: | **EntityCard** | [EntityCard.tsx](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/components/common/EntityCard.tsx) | Suspect cards with threat gauge, aliases, GPS location, and graph plot actions |\n104: | **AlertCard** | [AlertCard.tsx](file:///C:/Users/Nityam%20Jaiswal/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexus/src/components/common/AlertCard.tsx) | Operational alert cards with AI confidence meter, source tag, and triage actions |\n105: \n106: ---\n107: \n108: ## Verification Results\n109: \n110: ### Build Verification\n111: - Executed `npm run build`:\n112:   - `tsc -b` passed with 0 errors.\n113:   - `vite build` completed in **788ms**.\n114:   - Generated assets: `dist/index.html` (1.28 kB), `dist/assets/index.css` (37.84 kB), `dist/assets/index.js` (421.70 kB).\n115: \n116: ### Live Server & Route HTTP Verification\n117: - Vite development server started at `http://localhost:5173/`.\n118: - Tested all 8 routes via automated HTTP requests:\n119:   - `GET /` ➔ **200 OK**\n120:   - `GET /login` ➔ **200 OK**\n121:   - `GET /cases` ➔ **200